  "gear": "New Balance Hierro v8  Shadow Grey",
  "description": "Had a great zero day in Lake City at a motel the first night and the hostel the second. Finished my WFR recert stuff on my phone. Caught the ghost tour at 7:00 p.m. caught a hitch from the guy who gave the ghost tour the next morning haha. His buddy Doug gave me his phone number and said he could put me up if I ever visit Lake City or Arizona again. Leaves are in full swing around Lake City. Successfully managed my way around the two storms of the afternoon. Was on the Hard Rock 100 course for part of today, not sure how much. Set up my tent briefly at one point during the day. Found a good campsite with some CDT hikers that joined later.",
